### ========== CONTACTS TESTS ==========

### GET all contacts
GET http://localhost:3000/contacts

### GET single contact (replace ID after you create one)
GET http://localhost:3000/contacts/YOUR_ID_HERE

### POST - Create a contact
POST http://localhost:3000/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Max",
    "lastName": "Tinka",
    "email": "maxtinka7@gmail.com",
    "favoriteColor": "red",
    "birthday": "1996-09-16"
}

### PUT - Update a contact (replace ID)
PUT http://localhost:3000/contacts/YOUR_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Max",
    "lastName": "Tinka",
    "email": "maxtinka7@gmail.com",
    "favoriteColor": "purple",
    "birthday": "1996-09-16"
}

### DELETE - Delete a contact (replace ID)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/contacts/YOUR_ID_HERE

### ========== USERS TESTS ==========

### GET all users
GET http://localhost:3000/users

### POST - Create a user
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "maxtinka",
    "email": "maxtinka7@gmail.com",
    "firstName": "Max",
    "lastName": "Tinka",
    "age": 28,
    "isActive": true
}

### PUT - Update a user (replace ID)
PUT http://localhost:3000/users/YOUR_USER_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "maxtinka",
    "email": "maxtinka7@gmail.com",
    "firstName": "Max",
    "lastName": "Tinka",
    "age": 29,
    "isActive": true
}

### DELETE - Delete a user (replace ID)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/users/YOUR_USER_ID_HERE